<title>JAPAN: Hokkaido Takushoku to cut staff to 5,000 by 2000.</title>
<headline>Hokkaido Takushoku to cut staff to 5,000 by 2000.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hokkaido Takushoku Bank Ltd said on Friday that it would cut its work force to 5,000 by the end of March 31, 2000, from 5,670 at the end of September 1996.</p>
</text>
